        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3835-3859"><rb>面喰</rb><rt>めんくら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3859-3871">つたのは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3871-3907"><rb>神奈川縣</rb><rt>かながはけん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3907-3910">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3910-3940"><rb>警察部</rb><rt>けいさつぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3940-3946">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3946-3958"><rb>斯</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3958-3964">くの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3964-3979"><rb>如</rb><rt>ごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3979-3982">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3982-4006"><rb>迷信</rb><rt>めいしん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4006-4012">を、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4012-4024"><rb>成</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4024-4030">すが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4030-4045"><rb>儘</rb><rt>まゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4045-4048">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4048-4075"><rb>増長</rb><rt><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-4075-4150"><lem>ぞうちやう</lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-4129-4144">ぢうちやう</seg></rdg></app></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4150-4165">さしては、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4165-4198"><rb>保安上</rb><rt>ほあんじやう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4198-4219"><rb>容易</rb><rt>ようい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4219-4228">ならぬ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4228-4252"><rb>問題</rb><rt>もんだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4252-4288">であるといふので（それに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4288-4303"><rb>濫</rb><rt>みだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4303-4309">りに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4309-4342"><rb>神社呼</rb><rt>じんじやよば</rt></ruby><